  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Energy Solutions for Critical and Social Infrastructure Resistance - Danish Red Cross</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to enhance the resilience and security of energy supply for critical and social infrastructure in Mykolaiv and Ukraine. This is done by assuring that continuous hybrid energy supply is provided for public critical and social infrastructure to improve energy security and service reliability and by installing and procure 1) generators, 2) hybrid energy supply systems (EcoFlow Units &#x2013; solar panels), 3) Modular Electrical Stations which supply temporal electric supply quickly.</narrative>
  </description>
